<title>MEXICO: GMD enters Mexico water project.</title>
<headline>GMD enters Mexico water project.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-01-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Grupo Mexicano de Desarollo (GMD) said on Thursday it took a 50 percent stake in a project to renovate, expand and operate a water treatment plant in San Juan del Rio, in the central state of Queretaro.</p>
<p>It said the cost of the project will be 27.3 million pesos and the contract will run for 15 years from the end of construction work.</p>
<p>((--Henry Tricks, Mexico City newsroom +525 728-9560))</p>
